{"title":"Lots and Lots and Lots of Control Panels","link":"https://kottke.org/26/10/lots-and-lots-and-lots-of-control-panels","date":1791390720000,"content":"\n         \t<p>To go along with <a href=\"https://kottke.org/26/10/so-many-amazing-control-rooms\">my recent post about control rooms</a>, <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/groups/controlpanel/pool\">here’s the Control Panels group on Flickr</a>, containing almost 3000 photos of control interfaces for all kinds of things.</p>\n\t<p>You’ll see some of the same photos as in <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/groups/419512@N22/pool\">the Control Rooms group</a>, but when you get past the first couple of pages, there’s more variety: fiddly knobs, entire walls of nearly identical switches, dials, inscrutable gauges, soda machine interfaces, bump it and you might die buttons, computers with switches, Swinging Fingers (!!), and many more…</p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791350228-b2eba316.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791350228-b2eba316.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791350228-b2eba316.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791350281-00cb8eb2.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791350281-00cb8eb2.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791350281-00cb8eb2.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791350561-d32f5582.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791350561-d32f5582.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image